  "notes": "{中断|ちゅうだん} implies a temporary stop, with potential for resumption.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {中断|ちゅうだん}する: to interrupt, suspend\n- {中断|ちゅうだん}される: to be interrupted\n- {中断|ちゅうだん}なく: without interruption\n\nSIMILAR:\n- {中止|ちゅうし}: cancellation, stop (more final)\n- {休止|きゅうし}: pause, suspension (more formal)\n- {一時停止|いちじていし}: temporary pause",
